1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,970
C.

2
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:07,290
Simon and Kitty are talking about how many friends to have.

3
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:11,720
Work in pairs and discuss your own ideas.

4
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:16,945
Use the conversation below as a model.

5
00:00:16,945 --> 00:00:25,370
Simon, which do you think is better, having lots of friends or just a few?

6
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:30,280
I think it's better to have lots of friends. Really?

7
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:36,010
I think it's more important to have a few really good friends.

8
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:44,400
But if you have lots of friends, you can play team games together, like football or basketball.

9
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:46,740
Yes, that's true.

10
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:52,790
But if you have just a few friends, you can get to know each other better.

11
00:00:52,790 --> 00:00:56,930
You can also have more time to support each other.

12
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:58,980
Maybe you have a point.
